About MichaelMy name is Michael Cloud, husband, father, and grateful citizen of the United States. I have a passion for helping people and making a difference in our communities, state and nation. Thats why Im running to represent our 27th District of Texas in Congress.
For over a decade, I have been a leader in advancing the conservative principles upon which our nation was founded.

