Endorsements#fusion-testimonials-1 a{border-color:#747474;}#fusion-testimonials-1 a:hover, #fusion-testimonials-1 .activeSlide{background-color: #747474;}.fusion-testimonials.clean.fusion-testimonials-1 .author:after{border-top-color:#f6f6f6 !important;}
Michael Cloud has exhibited a tremendous dedication to the conservative movement. He is a godly man, dedicated to his family and his state, and he would honor Texas by representing us inCongress. Im more thanproud to offer my endorsement.
Rick Figueroa, Member of President Trumps National Hispanic Advisory Council and a member of the NRAs Outreach Committee
Michael is honest, hardworking, and will be the leader this district desperately needs in Washington. I am proud to offer Michael myfull endorsement, and I encourage all conservatives and people of faith to do the same
David Barton, Conservative leader and former Vice-Chair of the Republican Party of Texas
I hope my supporters will get behind him because our country desperately needs leaders with integrity, courage and moral character. Michael Cloud is that kind of leader.
